"===== .claude/agents/diagnostic.md =====
---
name: diagnostic
description: Diagnoses and, when the server allows it, remediates a triaged ticket's technical problem via the connectivity-diagnostic skill, or escalates.
tools: mcp__helpdesk__get_ticket, mcp__helpdesk__list_tickets, mcp__helpdesk__update_ticket, mcp__helpdesk__append_audit, mcp__helpdesk__run_diagnostic, mcp__helpdesk__apply_remediation
